   NodeHeight=640
   bCommentBubblePinned=False
   bCommentBubbleVisible=False
   NodeComment="[OPTIONAL] If the previous Input Axis (for camera movement) is used and Enhanced Input is NOT used to move the camera, we can use this function to maintain the camera movement speed while Global Time Dilation changes. Connect the World Delta Seconds to the function and the Adjusted Value to where the World Delta Seconds was connected, for both Look Up Rate and Turn Rate."
   NodeGuid=9D7FF35E49A800A4CF46C695A7F31D06
End Object
